                                                "sense_id": "2202de3f-74b0-3723-a0bc-bad0ebe5fece",
                                                "text": "Now, you know that the classical analytical explanation of agoraphobia of the early 1900s was that it represented a street phobia because the patient equated streetwalking with prostitutional activity[…]"
